<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "SE\自転車こぐ.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "800" "3000" "WAIT"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\桜道夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "ネジの壊れたロボット.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "30"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>I kept pedaling my bike at full speed.
{STOPSND "VOICE" "5000" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That was because I didn't want the people I passed to see my face.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I was about to cry under the moonlight.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, the tears were already flowing.<PG>
As I pedaled, in my heart I apologized to <STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> over and over.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ中思い出.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "NORMAL" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"For me, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s important, but you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, are really important too. So, don't do anything reckless."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I know that! Please trust me!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> had worried about my safety and told me to stop investigating.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And in answer to that, I had told her to trust me.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\桜道夜.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
But, I had already decided.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I can't forgive the culprit who made <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> sad, no matter what.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had no intention at all of stopping the investigation.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Right now, I could still hold off on acting and make it so I never <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="だま">deceived</STYLE> her.<PG>
Even so, I won't stop.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm sorry, I told a lie.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="だま">deceived</STYLE> <STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE>...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This is no small lie.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> worried about my safety, and yet I'm about to <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="ほご">throw that away</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had held a conviction that I would never do anything like <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="だま">deceiving</STYLE> the people who mattered to me.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\教室.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Ever since I was little, studying was the one thing I was good at.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Since before I started elementary school, teachers and parents alike had praised me: genius, genius.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I say I was good at studying, but it's not as if I'd done anything special.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's probably the thing called talent, but I think of it as one of my individual traits.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just because I was good at studying, I didn't mean to be stuck-up about it, either.<PG>
But, maybe people found someone like me hard to approach; I never made anyone I could call a friend.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Compared to getting good scores on tests, or being praised by teachers, my desire to join everyone's circle was stronger.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If my test results were about the same as everyone else's, could I join everyone's circle?<PG>
Once, I got a bad score on a test on purpose.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was a bad score by my standards, a score a little above average.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島家リビング思い出.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
When I got home and showed her my test score, Mom sadly furrowed her <STYLE ID="6" RUBY="みけん">brow</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="3">Erina</STYLE>, what's wrong? Did something hard happen? You can tell me anything, okay?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The situation didn't change.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If anything, I had made Mom sad.<PG>
I stopped getting bad scores, and on the next test I got my usual score.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Mom was very happy.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Right then, a grin from ear to ear had come out on my face on its own.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Oh my, <STYLE ID="3">Erina</STYLE>, that smile, it's very nice."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I see. Even just this much changes the impression you make quite a lot.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\教室.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Ever since then, I'd gotten into the habit of grinning from ear to ear.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And then, strangely, classmates had started to gather around me on their own.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I was happy. I was very happy.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But...<PG>
Even so, my personality didn't change.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I was bad at reaching out on my own, and somehow I kept people at a distance.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Strictly speaking, I think I couldn't fully trust the people around me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What part of me were they all seeing?<PG>
If it was only the smile, then in the end that was only the surface.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If the person that was me couldn't be accepted, things might go right back to how they were.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's why I just couldn't lay myself bare to the people around me.<PG>
The decisive reason I felt that way was that everyone called me "<STYLE ID="3">Erina-chan</STYLE>."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Between friends, people called each other by just their names, or by weird nicknames, and with me there was none of that at all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It might have been selfish, but for me, with my oddly sharp eye for observation, that was what made me feel the gap between me and the people around me.<PG>
I know the reason.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The title "genius girl" that had stuck to me at some point, and the overestimation that came with it: the fear that they would widen the distance between me and the people around me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For me, "genius girl" was far from a strength; it was a complex.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But, if I stopped that, I would make Mom sad again.<PG>
That attitude of mine must have come across to the people around me, too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I did find a few people I could talk with a little, but not enough to call friends; my personality stayed as gloomy as ever, and only my smile took on a life of its own.<PG>
Unable to approach the people around me, unable to back away, the desire for friends and the anxiety of showing myself: I was <STYLE ID="7" RUBY="くもん">in agony</STYLE> amid these conflicting feelings.<PG>
{MESOFF "2000"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
And then, once I was in middle school, I met <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>, who happened to be in the same club.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"So your name's </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">. Nice to meet you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even the upperclassmen had called me "<STYLE ID="3">Erina-chan</STYLE>," but the first to call me by just my name was <STYLE ID="2">her</STYLE>.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Genius girl? Yeah, I've heard that. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Hey, hey, more importantly, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, I've got a friend called </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, and―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For me, who had only ever dealt with people who got defensive over the "genius girl" reputation, <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>'s attitude was fresh, and it didn't make me feel any wall.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>, who always paid attention to me at the same eye level, I little by little became able to show myself, too.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "NORMAL" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
And also with the one I got to know through <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>, <STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"So this one's the genius girl </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">! Huh, you're a total shorty!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Sh... shorty...?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey now, are </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> eating properly? Isn't all the nutrition going to your brain, so your growth stopped?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I-I do eat properly... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">I may not look it, but I'm</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">pretty... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">um... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">a big eater..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み全身.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh? What'd you say? You're too quiet, I can't hear you!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">E... </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">even like this, I'm a big eater!!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Oho! All right, in honor of our meeting, I'll act like a senpai and treat you to something at Zahha! Let's see it, then, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s so-called big appetite!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "NORMAL" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ中思い出.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto-sama</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... I'm sorry. Please, have mercy already..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, you're amaaazing! Couldn't you enter an eating contest!?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Damn... my allowance for this month... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">! After I treated you to all this, you'd better keep me company when I'm free!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Right, right, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s not in any club, and she's got a lot of time on her hands."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">...! You guys, show your elders a little more respect!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Huh? </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, you're a third-year!? You don't have any composure at all, do you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh...! You've got some nerve, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">...!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Like this, before I was even aware of it, the chances to lay myself bare kept growing.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I really like who I am now.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I can discover a me I never knew before, and every day is fun.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There are people who accept that, and it's so much fun.<PG>
That I could become who I am now is thanks to <STYLE ID="2">her</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And being brought together with <STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE>, that is also thanks to <STYLE ID="2">her</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
People like these, at least, I'll live without ever doing anything like <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="だま">deceiving</STYLE> them.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That was what I had vowed.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\桜道夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I'm sorry... I'm sorry...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Me right now, I must have the face from before I learned to smile, from that lonely time.<PG>
Toward the moon, I grinned from ear to ear as hard as I could.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's all right... surely it's all right.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The time will come when the three of us can meet with smiles like this again.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For that, I chose this path.<PG>
I pedaled my bike hard.
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
